  -s, --signature <SIGNATURE>  Signature to use (overrides config default)
      --no-signature           Skip signature entirely
  -A, --account <ACCOUNT>      Account to use (default: first in config)
  -h, --help                   Print help

$ mp sync --help
Sync mailboxes from the server into the local store

Usage: mp sync [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -n, --limit <LIMIT>          Max messages per mailbox (default: 50) [default: 50]
